<title>JAPAN: Powdertech - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Powdertech - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.12		vs	    2.89</p>
<p> Operating	  497    million	  vs	  481    million</p>
<p> Current	    498    million	  vs	  470    million</p>
<p> Net		  259    million	  vs	  258    million</p>
